 Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#sasha-maries-set)\n- [Budgie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#budgies-set)\n- [Skinny Macho's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set)\n\nAlso listen to [Soulection All Day 2019](/episodes/all-day-2019/).\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-01-01T14:41:45+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"is5fereFXH0","position":47,"timestamp":"01:50:27","rawTrack":"Penthouse Penthouse - voice mailz <3 <3 <3","track":{"id":"IovMILyyASI","path":"/artists/penthouse-penthouse/tracks/voice-mailz-3-3-3/","slug":"voice-mailz-3-3-3","title":"Voice Mailz <3 <3 <3","artist":{"slug":"penthouse-penthouse","title":"Penthouse Penthouse"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"9MtqvaStm34","slug":"547","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-547/ra.1619426080","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-547"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #547","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-547.jpg","content":"A fusion of dub, R&B edits, nostalgic tunes, and new music.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-04-30T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"Wo0SD6m1Hds","position":12,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Penthouse Penthouse - Cruis'n","track":{"id":"lfboCnWWgRU","path":"/artists/penthouse-penthouse/tracks/cruis-n/","slug":"cruisn","title":"Cruis'n","artist":{"slug":"penthouse-penthouse","title":"Penthouse Penthouse"},"artwork":"images/artists/penthouse-penthouse/tracks/cruis-n.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"PXQa1HxDvAg","slug":"136","tags":[1,2,15],"links":{"mixcloud":"https://www.mixcloud.com/soulection/show-136-w-astronautica/"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #136 w/ Astronautica","artwork":"/images/episodes/136.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10761,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-07-13T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"UE4jfX4P69c","position":10,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Penthouse Penthouse - When It's Hot","track":{"id":"5CNrZAmEKIw","path":"/artists/penthouse-penthouse/tracks/when-it-s-hot/","slug":"when-its-hot","title":"When It's Hot","artist":{"slug":"penthouse-penthouse","title":"Penthouse Penthouse"},"artwork":"images/artists/penthouse-penthouse/tracks/when-it-s-hot.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"lvLR-jIK1BU","slug":"145","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-145"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #145","artwork":"/images/episodes/145.jpg","content":"\nJoe selects 60 minutes of energy from Soulection HQ\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":3662,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-21T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"y9wlf1UFmj8","position":0,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Penthouse Penthouse - Voice Mailz","track":{"id":"_Fl_llLZbD4","path":"/artists/penthouse-penthouse/tracks/voice-mailz/","slug":"voice-mailz","title":"voice mailz","artist":{"slug":"penthouse-penthouse","title":"Penthouse Penthouse"},"artwork":"images/artists/penthouse-penthouse/tracks/voice-mailz.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"6HHQNRsrLR0","slug":"146","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-146"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #146","artwork":"/images/episodes/146.jpg","content":"Joe Kay hits hard with 3 hours of HEAVY tracks on 1 hour of sleep\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThere is something for everybody in here. Lots of unreleased music + music that was forgotten about. Shouts to all the amazing people who tuned in to the live show. Every once in a while we like to make a post about the location of our radio listeners and it's always inspiring to see how many people are actually tuning in and the locations that they reside in. We can't even pronounce some of the cities/countries! Talk about worldwide. Lets keep it moving.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-28T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"5gsqYFXmRDE","position":3,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Penthouse Penthouse - Private Jet","track":{"id":"IKK66yfU66Q","path":"/artists/penthouse-penthouse/tracks/private-jet/","slug":"private-jet","title":"Private Jet","artist":{"slug":"penthouse-penthouse","title":"Penthouse Penthouse"},"artwork":"images/artists/penthouse-penthouse/tracks/private-jet.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"72tsP5bkPCY","slug":"157","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-157"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #157","artwork":"/images/episodes/157.jpg","content":"Joe Kay drops a 60 minute set of some stand out selects that he either just discovered, was holding onto, and rediscovered. \n\n<!--more-->\nWe played back a few cuts from last week such as the intro track by Yung Gud! God this track is a bad one even Sango is opening up with it at his recent shows.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":3723,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-12-21T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"KX9RxgSC-d4","position":31,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Penthouse Penthouse - Private Jet","track":{"id":"IKK66yfU66Q","path":"/artists/penthouse-penthouse/tracks/private-jet/","slug":"private-jet","title":"Private Jet","artist":{"slug":"penthouse-penthouse","title":"Penthouse Penthouse"},"artwork":"images/artists/penthouse-penthouse/tracks/private-jet.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"TRF9MBRGUQ8","slug":"160","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-160-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #160 w/ Zikomo","artwork":"/images/episodes/160.jpg","content":"Zikomo gives us a special 1 hour set of exclusive tracks\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10949,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-11T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"8iTtnjSBahU","position":32,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Penthouse Penthouse - Cruis'n","track":{"id":"lfboCnWWgRU","path":"/artists/penthouse-penthouse/tracks/cruis-n/","slug":"cruisn","title":"Cruis'n","artist":{"slug":"penthouse-penthouse","title":"Penthouse Penthouse"},"artwork":"images/artists/penthouse-penthouse/tracks/cruis-n.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"TRF9MBRGUQ8","slug":"160","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-160-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #160 w/ Zikomo","artwork":"/images/episodes/160.jpg","content":"Zikomo gives us a special 1 hour set of exclusive tracks\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10949,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-11T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"n3O85F6kQSc","position":3,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Penthouse Penthouse - MIAMI","track":{"id":"yd_GyYiXzXg","path":"/artists/penthouse-penthouse/tracks/miami/","slug":"miami","title":"MIAMI","artist":{"slug":"penthouse-penthouse","title":"Penthouse Penthouse"},"artwork":"images/artists/penthouse-penthouse/tracks/miami.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"KGbt4wCudfQ","slug":"168","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-168-sxsw"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #168 (SXSW Pre Show)","artwork":"/images/episodes/168.jpg","content":"Joe kay getting you ready for SXSW.\n<!--more-->\n\nAs we are getting ready for SXSW we wanted to get you in the spirit. Joe Kay went solo again to keep things simple and focused. He kicked it off with the new Carmack/Esta collab, played some new discoveries/unreleased gems, and then switched up the whole format by letting the live listener selects the music by sending us our requests via our social media networks. What a beautiful thing! For over 2 hours, you had the chance to selects the music, Joe was just the provider! What a great way to collaborate right? Since we will be at SXSW from (March 11-16) there won't be a live Soulection Radio show next week, however, we do have a special guest mix to make up for it. Stay tuned.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10818,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-03-08T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"P2o4ZixYBSY","position":30,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Penthouse Penthouse - Voice Mailz <3 <3 <3","track":{"id":"IovMILyyASI","path":"/artists/penthouse-penthouse/tracks/voice-mailz-3-3-3/","slug":"voice-mailz-3-3-3","title":"Voice Mailz <3 <3 <3","artist":{"slug":"penthouse-penthouse","title":"Penthouse Penthouse"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"5Xbl7MTHePo","slug":"172","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-172-w-rhettmatic-beat-junkies"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #172 w/ Rhettmatic (Beat Junkies)","artwork":"/images/episodes/172.jpg","content":"Rhettmatic of the legendary beat Junkies Crew graces us with a 50 minute set + an in depth interview. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nRhett is definitely one of the most humble guests we've had on here and is more connected than anyone really knows. Do yourself a favor and get mentally prepared to learn a lot. It's much more than just music. Shouts to Rhettmatic, Mr. Choc, J. Rocc, and the rest of the Beat Junkies crew. Also, big big up to Free The Robots for coming through the studio and vibing with us. Much love to you & the whole Crosby crew. Stay tuned for much more to come. Enjoy.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10880,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-26T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"-dzzCBd4QZE","position":46,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Penthouse Penthouse - When It's Hot","track":{"id":"5CNrZAmEKIw","path":"/artists/penthouse-penthouse/tracks/when-it-s-hot/","slug":"when-its-hot","title":"When It's Hot","artist":{"slug":"penthouse-penthouse","title":"Penthouse Penthouse"},"artwork":"images/artists/penthouse-penthouse/tracks/when-it-s-hot.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"MUTAwmt5Mm0","slug":"173","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-173"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #173","artwork":"/images/episodes/173.jpg","content":"Joe Kay makes it to the studio in time to throw down an unforgettable set full of primarily forgotten classics that will have you reminiscing on life.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nAs if this news isn't enough, we just hit 100K here on Soundcloud this past Friday literally while we launched our new residency @ the legendary Echoplex! Talk about timing and accomplishments. THANK you to each and every one of you for supporting us and spreading this sound to everyone. We plan to give you something really soon to celebrate 100K supporters worldwide and more. Big ups to the 900+ people who showed up to The Sound of Tomorrow this past Friday. Very inspiring.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10836,"location":"US","pu